a2ui-kmp
Sponsored by LittlePress.AI (https://littlepress.ai)

This project builds Google's Agent-to-UI renderer for Jetpack Compose (A2UI) on Kotlin Multiplatform.

source/a2ui/ and source/material3-a2ui/ are unmodified copies of the Android Open Source Project's
platform/frameworks/support repository (see source/UPSTREAM), Copyright The Android Open Source Project,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

target/a2ui-kmp/a2ui-compat contains code derived from the Android Open Source Project, under the same license:
- androidx/core/util/PatternsCompat (androidx.core), in PatternsCompat.kt
- android.util.JsonReader, in JsonReader.kt
- resource locale matching from platform/frameworks/base libs/androidfw (ResourceTypes.cpp,
  LocaleData.cpp), in ResourceLocales.kt, with the tables of LocaleDataTables.cpp generated into
  LocaleDataTables.kt

target/a2ui-kmp/a2ui-compat contains data generated from the Unicode Common Locale Data Repository (CLDR 45),
Copyright Unicode, Inc., under the Unicode License v3 (https://www.unicode.org/license.txt):
plural rules (CldrPluralRules.kt). The identifier character table (IdentifierChars.kt), the
numbering system table (AndroidNumbering.kt) and the date and time patterns
(AndroidDatePatterns.kt) were recorded from Android 15.

The rest of target/, samples/, scripts/ and tests/ are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE).
